title Mine Field: a game saved by the first version (fixed 9x9, no preset) on a screen with other boards: dropped, not a crash
sizes 800x480 480x800 640x480
env MINEFIELD_TEST_DATA s3-old-save-dropped
env MINEFIELD_TEST_RESET 1
env MINEFIELD_TEST_OLDSAVE 1
env MINEFIELD_TEST_DIMS 8x7x7,11x9x14,18x12x40

wait 400
expect text "Saved game dropped: screen changed"
shot old-dropped
check old-dropped
